   "subject": "Constrain random effect precisions to be equal",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div>If I have two random effects in the model, can I constrain the precision for each to be equal?  </div><div> </div><div>example:</div><div> </div><div><b><font color=\"#800080\"><font color=\"#800080\"></font></font></b><font color=\"#800080\"><font color=\"#800080\"></font></font><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">#simulate data</font></font></font></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">n &lt;- 1000</font></font></font></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">v &lt;- rnorm(n)<u></u><u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">w &lt;- rnorm(n)<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">i &lt;- rep(1:50,each=n/50)<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">j &lt;- rep(1:50,each=n/50)<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">beta.1 &lt;- rnorm(50)*sqrt(.5)<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">beta.2 &lt;- rnorm(50)*sqrt(.5)<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">var(beta.1)<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">var(beta.2)<u></u><u></u></font></font></font></p><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">y &lt;- 0 + beta.1[i] * v + beta.2[j] * w + rnorm(n)</font></font></font></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">#estimate model</font></font></font></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><u></u><font size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font><font size=\"3\">formula = y ~ v + w + f(i, v, model=&quot;iid&quot;) + f(j,\nw,model=&quot;iid&quot;)<u></u><u></u></font><u></u></font></font></font></p><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><font size=\"3\">\n\n\n\n</font><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\">result = inla(formula,data = data.frame(y, v, w, i, j),family\n= c(&quot;gaussian&quot;))</font></font></font></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\">#Can I force the precision of i to equal the precision for j?</font></font></font></p><font face=\"Times New Roman\"><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><font size=\"3\">\n\n</font></p></font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\" class=\"MsoNormal\"></p></font></font></font><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">\n\n</font></div>"
    ]
   ]
